--TEST--
a property whose declared type carries no qualifier keeps its default on screen — the declaration-side answer is the property's own type and not the fact that it is a property, so concealing one here would be the over-redaction ADR 0101 § 1 refuses
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Config {
  public string $name = "novis";
  public secret string $key = "sk-live-0";
}
--REQUEST--
redactions
--EXPECT--
